{"4982380":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"STUFFED: Two Foot Hero","steam_appid":4982380,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5290170],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Protect your owner!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a teddy bear and fight to protect your owner from waves of nightmares invading her dreams. Armed with homemade weapons and defenses, you'll battle through twisted dream worlds in an action-packed VR shooter that blends frantic combat with strategic survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/11de6ed1eed0311c34746c41f658ce03.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy bear hands\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/11de6ed1eed0311c34746c41f658ce03.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/11de6ed1eed0311c34746c41f658ce03.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Play solo or with friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the nightmares alone or team up online with up to 4 players. Coordinate your defenses, revive fallen teammates, and survive increasingly overwhelming enemy attacks together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/e6c596b4e33a375d19106690bfb64dcf.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy waving at another teddy\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/e6c596b4e33a375d19106690bfb64dcf.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/e6c596b4e33a375d19106690bfb64dcf.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Survive the nightmare<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through six unique dream-inspired maps as you face everything from garden gnomes and rubber ducks to skeletons and shadow monsters. Complete ten escalating waves to conquer each night, or jump into Endless Mode and see how long you can survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/6478a24eab29c305ece3480cd4ff80fc.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddies shooting enemies\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/6478a24eab29c305ece3480cd4ff80fc.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/6478a24eab29c305ece3480cd4ff80fc.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Fight with homemade weapons<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast enemies with an arsenal built from everyday household objects, dual-wield your favorites, physically reload in VR, and upgrade your firepower at the weapon station.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/883f1cce4bcc9994902d0528d93aadf8.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy shooting enemies\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/883f1cce4bcc9994902d0528d93aadf8.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/883f1cce4bcc9994902d0528d93aadf8.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Build the perfect defense<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct barricades, traps, and manual turrets to hold back the nightmare hordes. Upgrade and repair damaged defenses, reinforce your position, and prepare before the next wave begins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/216061732d3489927441d306f55116d7.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy building a barricade\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/216061732d3489927441d306f55116d7.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/216061732d3489927441d306f55116d7.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Make your teddy truly yours<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your teddy and unlock outfit and fur customizations to create your own unique Two Foot Hero. Master your favorite weapons to unlock exclusive skins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/21037b125588faceb93dd3a1ca0ebc17.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddies trying on different outfits\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/21037b125588faceb93dd3a1ca0ebc17.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/21037b125588faceb93dd3a1ca0ebc17.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Protect your owner!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a teddy bear and fight to protect your owner from waves of nightmares invading her dreams. Armed with homemade weapons and defenses, you'll battle through twisted dream worlds in an action-packed VR shooter that blends frantic combat with strategic survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/11de6ed1eed0311c34746c41f658ce03.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy bear hands\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/11de6ed1eed0311c34746c41f658ce03.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/11de6ed1eed0311c34746c41f658ce03.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Play solo or with friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the nightmares alone or team up online with up to 4 players. Coordinate your defenses, revive fallen teammates, and survive increasingly overwhelming enemy attacks together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/e6c596b4e33a375d19106690bfb64dcf.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy waving at another teddy\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/e6c596b4e33a375d19106690bfb64dcf.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/e6c596b4e33a375d19106690bfb64dcf.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Survive the nightmare<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through six unique dream-inspired maps as you face everything from garden gnomes and rubber ducks to skeletons and shadow monsters. Complete ten escalating waves to conquer each night, or jump into Endless Mode and see how long you can survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/6478a24eab29c305ece3480cd4ff80fc.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddies shooting enemies\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/6478a24eab29c305ece3480cd4ff80fc.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/6478a24eab29c305ece3480cd4ff80fc.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Fight with homemade weapons<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast enemies with an arsenal built from everyday household objects, dual-wield your favorites, physically reload in VR, and upgrade your firepower at the weapon station.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/883f1cce4bcc9994902d0528d93aadf8.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy shooting enemies\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/883f1cce4bcc9994902d0528d93aadf8.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/883f1cce4bcc9994902d0528d93aadf8.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Build the perfect defense<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct barricades, traps, and manual turrets to hold back the nightmare hordes. Upgrade and repair damaged defenses, reinforce your position, and prepare before the next wave begins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/216061732d3489927441d306f55116d7.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddy building a barricade\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/216061732d3489927441d306f55116d7.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/216061732d3489927441d306f55116d7.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐻 Make your teddy truly yours<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your teddy and unlock outfit and fur customizations to create your own unique Two Foot Hero. Master your favorite weapons to unlock exclusive skins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/21037b125588faceb93dd3a1ca0ebc17.poster.avif?t=1793721676\" aria-label=\"Teddies trying on different outfits\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/21037b125588faceb93dd3a1ca0ebc17.webm?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/extras\/21037b125588faceb93dd3a1ca0ebc17.mp4?t=1793721676\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Become a two-foot-tall teddy bear in this VR wave shooter where you wield homemade weapons, build defences, and protect a little girl from her nightmares. Play solo or online in up to 4 player co-op.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/d0c2eb667e83117d53d27bec9dfe9d04755db229\/header.jpg?t=1793721676","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/9a4a8f749ea90588251a53c4151c8f19c0b89159\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793721676","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4982380\/9a4a8f749ea90588251a53c4151c8f19c0b89159\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793721676","website":"https:\/\/www.wavingbearstudio.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7 11700F (Or similar)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 (Or similar)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> SteamVR<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> The game was built to run on Meta Quest 3 and so should be able to run on most standard gaming PC setups<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul 